  "releaseNotes": "1.6.0: the exFAT bridge accepts an empty path as the volume root; otherwise no native changes - version-aligned with HCVault.Core 1.6.0 (keyfile streams, folder import/export, automatic HCVault.Native dependency). Volumes are compatible with 1.4.x/1.5.x (same vcapi v4).",
